    "body": "TDD RED first. This branch replaces the superseded custom HQ-memory production path with a thin derived SALVADOR shadow consumer over the already-merged GitHub-native Permanent Archive V1.\n\nReuse only:\n- existing ZB Permanent Archive V1 raw/event archive\n- Git/GitHub Actions runtime\n- Python stdlib glue only\n\nTarget laws:\n- RESULT_READY != QC PASS\n- runtime evidence never self-promotes skill\n- evaluator evidence may update categorical UNTESTED/FAILED/PARTIAL/PROVEN state\n- LOCKED is never self-awarded\n- raw archive stays immutable/source-of-truth\n- derived shadow records are append-only and reconstructable\n- no owner-PC daemon, polling, new DB, vector server, model/prompt/canon/profile mutation\n\nCurrent phase: RED test only. Do not merge until fresh exact-head CI and QC are green.",
    "changed_files": 3,
